#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md
msgid "**Usage**"
msgstr "**指定方法**"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md
msgid "Default (no `model` key needed)"
msgstr "デフォルト（`model` キー不要）"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md
msgid "Set `\"model\": \"fisheye\"` in params"
msgstr "パラメータに `\"model\": \"fisheye\"` を指定"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:17
msgid ""
"**Rule of thumb:** The pinhole model handles barrel distortion well for "
"most lenses, including typical wide-angle lenses. For cameras with "
"particularly strong distortion (e.g., surveillance cameras, action "
"cameras, webcams), the fisheye model provides better accuracy."
msgstr ""
"**目安:** ピンホールモデルは樽型歪みの補正機能を備えており、一般的な広角レンズを含む"
"ほとんどのレンズで良好に動作します。特に歪みが強いカメラ（監視カメラ、アクションカメラ、"
"ウェブカメラなど）では、フィッシュアイモデルの方が高い精度を発揮します。"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:19
msgid "Simulation Overlay"
msgstr "シミュレーション画像の重ね合わせ"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:21
msgid ""
"The image below shows a 50% blend of each model's simulated image over "
"the target photograph. A better-fitting model produces a sharper overlay "
"with less ghosting."
msgstr "下の画像は、各モデルのシミュレーション画像をターゲット写真に50%の透過度で重ね合わせたものです。フィットが良いモデルほど、二重像（ゴースト）が少なく鮮明に見えます。"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:23
msgid "![](_static/camera_model_comparison/overlay_comparison.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:25
msgid ""
"Since this scene was captured with a surveillance camera that has "
"particularly strong barrel distortion, the fisheye model produces a "
"tighter fit, especially near the image edges. For most lenses, including "
"typical wide-angle lenses, the pinhole model performs well thanks to its "
"own barrel distortion correction."
msgstr ""
"このシーンは特に樽型歪みが強い監視カメラで撮影されているため、フィッシュアイモデルの方が"
"よりフィットしています。特に画像端部で顕著です。一般的な広角レンズを含むほとんどの"
"レンズでは、ピンホールモデル自体の樽型歪み補正で十分な性能が得られます。"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:27
msgid "Matching Results"
msgstr "マッチング結果"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:29
msgid ""
"Feature matching (RoMa) between the target photograph and each model's "
"simulation:"
msgstr "ターゲット写真と各モデルのシミュレーション画像間の特徴点マッチング（RoMa）の結果:"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:31
msgid "**Pinhole (1852 matches):**"
msgstr "**ピンホール（1852点）:**"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:33
msgid "![](_static/camera_model_comparison/matched_pinhole.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:35
msgid "**Fisheye (1862 matches):**"
msgstr "**フィッシュアイ（1862点）:**"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:37
msgid "![](_static/camera_model_comparison/matched_fisheye.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:39
msgid ""
"Both models yield a similar number of matches, but the fisheye model's "
"matches are more spatially uniform because the simulation better "
"represents the actual geometry of this wide-angle camera."
msgstr "両モデルのマッチング数はほぼ同等ですが、フィッシュアイモデルの方が対応点の空間分布がより均一です。これは、シミュレーション画像がこの広角カメラの実際の幾何学をより正確に再現しているためです。"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:41
msgid "Reprojection Error"
msgstr "再投影誤差"

#: ../../camera_model_comparison.md:43
msgid ""
"Reprojection error measures how accurately the optimized camera "
"parameters project 3D ground control points back onto the image plane. "
"Lower is better."
msgstr "再投影誤差は、最適化されたカメラパラメータが3D地上基準点を画像平面上にどれだけ正確に投影できるかを測定する指標です。値が小さいほど良好です。"

